	<name>OSCAR</name>
	<summary>The Open Source CPAP Analysis Reporter</summary>
	<description>
		<p>OSCAR is PC software developed for reviewing and exploring data produced by CPAP and related machines used in the treatment of sleep apnea.</p>
		<p>It is a derivative of SleepyHead and reads data from the SD cards of supported CPAP machines and oximeters, presenting detailed graphs, statistics and reports.</p>
		<p>Features:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Detailed daily graphs of pressure, flow, leaks, events and oximetry</li>
			<li>Overview, statistics and printable reports across days, weeks and months</li>
			<li>Data stored in a local SQLite database that other tools can query directly</li>
			<li>Flexible CSV export and profile import/export</li>
		</ul>
		<p>OSCAR is not a medical device and is not intended for diagnosis. Discuss your therapy data with your doctor.</p>
	</description>
